  "body": "Step into Kensington Park with this generously proportioned home offering space, value and scope to make it your own.  This home offers an exciting opportunity to secure your place in one of Orewa's most sought after coastal communities.\r\n\r\n12 Parkside Drive is move in ready with plenty of scope to add your own touches and improvements over time. With 153m² overall, there's an impressive amount of space here, making it an ideal option for investors, first-home buyers, or anyone looking for a future home they can grow into.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the flat and overlooking a mature, tree lined reserve, the location is hard to beat. You're just moments from Kensington Park's much loved lifestyle amenities, including the heated indoor pool, gym, sauna, garden café, playground and beautifully landscaped grounds.\r\n\r\nInside, the multi-level layout provides generous living spaces, a functional open plan kitchen and well sized bedrooms, offering plenty of flexibility for different ages and stages of life.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features is the exceptionally generous tandem double garage, providing secure parking for two cars, a rare advantage within Kensington Park. Along with valuable additional space for storage, hobbies, bikes and sporting equipment.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the lifestyle. Enjoy an easy stroll to the native bush tracks of Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve, or continue on to the golden sands of Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have purchased and are motivated to see this property sold. If you've been waiting for an affordable entry point into Kensington Park, this is an opportunity worth acting on.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewing is available today - don't wait until the weekend. Call now to arrange your viewing or talk with our Kensington Park Property Specialists.\r\n\r\nTo view the property documents copy this link into your browser : https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/YN5Z",
